ACTION PLAN OCTOBER 22 2026

1. Implement the delivery-date policy end to end. [COMPLETED - commit b1957be]
Represent estimates as known, explicitly absent, or unknown. Use the latest date in a range, settle the calendar/timezone convention (America/New_York via UTC midnight conversion), revalidate immediately before submission, and persist the accepted estimate. Exactly 14 days passes; later dates reject with exact cancellation/readback and automated cart purging via removePreparedAmazonCartItem; ambiguous evidence stops for review. Covered by 11 unit tests in tests/delivery_cutoff.test.ts.

